<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.6330 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.6330 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.6330 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange on Thursday from 4.6325 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				     Sept 19		 Sept 17</p>
<p> Lei per dollar		  4.6330		  4.6325</p>
<p> Volume traded ($)	     20,000		  5,000</p>
<p>				     Sept 19		 Sept 18</p>
<p> Lei per 1,000 roubles	 0.8545		  0.8540</p>
<p> Volume traded (R million)   100		     200</p>
<p>--Moscow newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
